# The real run's invoice pages, 1,003 of them. Project 01 draws them in
# minutes and `refresh_live_data.py` brings them back, so they are not
# carried here. The CSV files beside them are committed, so every figure
# on the dashboard is there on a fresh clone; only the page behind the
# "open the PDF" link needs that one command first.
data-live/*.pdf

# The dashboard video this project copies. It is somebody else's work,
# so it stays on this machine. The frames cut from it, the author's own
# description and the step-by-step reading of it are in reference/ and
# are what the build was actually done from.
reference/*.mp4

# A 9 MB recording of the first version's overlay. The four PNGs in
# docs/ show the page as it is now, and 99-superseded/README.md says
# what the first version was.
99-superseded/*.gif

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
